  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "What we compared"
    },
    {
      "kind": "para",
      "text": "We standardised the annual filings of five listed payments businesses from SEC EDGAR XBRL, using each issuer's latest annual report filed on or before the information cutoff. Revenue, operating income, net income, operating cash flow and capital expenditure are taken as reported in the filings; every ratio below is computed from unrounded figures rather than from the rounded numbers printed here. The fiscal year-ends do not align.[[period_alignment]]"
    },
